{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Troubles and decay struck the cities, the villages were mired in the vices of madness, and people began to look for a reason for battle in order to throw out their aggression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852980/extras/2024_04_map.gif?t=1741796118\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the Necroking. Put on the crown of a powerful necromancy magic and embark on a dark and twisted journey to bring chaos and destruction to settlements desecrated by life itself. Raise an army of skeletons and other vile creatures to conquer your enemies and establish your dominion! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852980/extras/2024_04_deck.gif?t=1741796118\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become the Death Monarch</strong>. Harness the dark powers of necromancy and command an army of more than 30 undead minion types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-Time Tactical Gameplay</strong>. Engage in intense battles where strategic decision-making and quick reflexes are key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vast Skull Deckbuilding</strong>. Customize your playstyle by unlocking new Skulls and upgrading your units skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite Elements</strong>. Every playthrough is unique, with procedurally generated levels and unpredictable challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel Art Visuals</strong>. Immerse yourself in a beautifully hand-crafted world brought to life through stunning pixel-art graphics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852980/extras/2024_04_battle.gif?t=1741796118\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to unleash the ultimate power of necromancy and claim your rightful place as the feared Necroking. Are you ready to embrace the darkness and reshape the world in your image? The time has come to rise and conquer!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tight Defense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/df3faaeb0313d1e40ae925cfeb17d8df13d22540.jpg"},{"name":"Limit of Possibilities","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/4a1001f96e2a89aa51cc577cd9984abf2c12388c.jpg"},{"name":"Slow You Go","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/538b4ae2c7a488a1666374871720bec6ec505661.jpg"},{"name":"Not On My Watch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/d1c865c4a306a6b4e90e126a776250e88a8dc885.jpg"},{"name":"The Sacrifice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/438b468c7f5fa20d5fcb4f4089e5ab2c866ae286.jpg"},{"name":"That Was Quick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/baf0be69524691578a1caa6dae4eb68cc7275434.jpg"},{"name":"So Quick?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/95d161524d40fcee2b5efd6473077fc30230c936.jpg"},{"name":"Pest Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/fbef945dbb65b71c6c325384f34ad04bf8ef5b48.jpg"},{"name":"Elite Squad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/04f0965108507704526b17a2fdffd02794efe557.jpg"},{"name":"Parity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852980/a9b4c35a0f37e808fe6f42e58b7a3746f4472890.jpg"}],"total":38},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2852980?t=1741796118","background_raw":"https